<title>JAPAN: Nikkei Sept futures settlement estimated 20,544.31.</title>
<headline>Nikkei Sept futures settlement estimated 20,544.31.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The key Nikkei 225 average's September futures and options settlement price is estimated at 20,544.31, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The settlement price will be officially announced at the Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) after the market closes at 3 p.m. (0600 GMT).</p>
</text>
